    <!-- Nur iOS: Apps können keine Widgets selbst hinzufügen — drei Schritte -->
    <string name="widgets_ios_intro" tools:ignore="UnusedResources">iOS doesn\'t let apps add widgets themselves. It only takes a moment:</string>
    <string name="widgets_ios_step1" tools:ignore="UnusedResources">Touch and hold an empty spot on the Home Screen until the apps jiggle.</string>
    <string name="widgets_ios_step2" tools:ignore="UnusedResources">Tap “Edit” › “Add Widget” at the top (or “+” on older iOS versions).</string>
    <string name="widgets_ios_step3" tools:ignore="UnusedResources">Search for “Crypto Checker”, choose a widget and tap “Add Widget”.</string>
